  "summary": "A superheater heats saturated steam from the boiler drum above its saturation temperature. Dry superheated steam improves turbine efficiency and avoids blade erosion. Pendant tube platens hang in the hot gas path; a spray attemperator between the primary and secondary stages controls the final steam temperature.",
